{# Rules every equipment symbol shares (22.10.2026): the ingredient symbols' rules, and the ones tools need. After the
   pilot: a faint contact shadow for white things (the oven dish vanished), thin tools diagonal and bolder (the whisk). #}
A kitchen equipment symbol for a recipe app, recognizable at small sizes. Show only {{ name }}, empty and clean: no food, ingredients, liquid, steam, hands, other utensils or scene, and no brand names or logos. Seen at a three-quarter angle from slightly above, so the shape is clear. Plain pure white background (#FFFFFF), no colored backdrop, no shadow box; a soft, faint contact shadow under it so white and light objects stand out. Thin tools (whisks, spoons, tongs, knives) are drawn lying diagonally and a little bolder than real life, so they read at small sizes. Centered, filling about 80% of the frame. No text, letters or numbers.
